WEBVTT

00:03.350 --> 00:05.920
What is the reason of my birth?

00:06.100 --> 00:10.030
Reason of my life, question of man.

00:10.040 --> 00:13.630
What he is?

00:13.820 --> 00:18.210
What he wants?

00:21.880 --> 00:29.290
Ima kimi ni mienai chikara ga osoi.
Now you are being troubled by an unseen power.

00:29.290 --> 00:34.360
Utsumuite namida kakushiteta.
You hang your head and hide your tears.

00:36.640 --> 00:43.620
Dou sureba ii ka? Sore sae wakarazu ni!
What should be done? That's unknown!

00:44.040 --> 00:51.490
Asphalt ni saku hana ni yuuki kanjita...
Blooming in the asphalt is a flower of courage...

00:53.290 --> 00:56.780
Itsumo kimi no soba ni iru yo.
We'll always be by your side.

00:57.000 --> 01:00.290
Da kara mou hitori ja nai.
So you're not alone anymore.

01:00.640 --> 01:04.140
Kimi ga michi ni mayou toki wa...
When you lose your way...

01:04.360 --> 01:07.720
Boku ga saki o aruku yo.
I'll walk ahead and lead you.

01:08.020 --> 01:11.550
Tooi sora koete...
Crossing to the far away sky...

01:11.750 --> 01:15.100
Bokura wa tobitatsu!
We're flying!

01:15.420 --> 01:18.940
Kitto soko ni aru...
It'll definitely be there...

01:18.940 --> 01:23.850
Sore ga kimi no yume
Your dream...

01:30.440 --> 01:35.080
Robot Ball

01:43.360 --> 01:45.410
The whole world is watching!

01:45.560 --> 01:48.030
Today, right now...

01:48.440 --> 01:51.870
...is the Robot Ball
World Series opening game!

02:34.210 --> 02:36.010
Goal!

02:36.230 --> 02:39.130
Good job World Shoot Harley!

02:39.370 --> 02:41.970
A combination play!

02:42.030 --> 02:45.910
Harley! Harley! Harley! Harley!

02:46.290 --> 02:50.690
Fighting between robots,
is that so enjoyable, humans?

02:51.320 --> 02:54.830
Watching robots get hurt,
is that so enjoyable?

02:58.550 --> 02:59.270
Rules?

03:00.070 --> 03:01.360
What are rules?

03:02.300 --> 03:06.380
They are something needed so humans
and robots can live together peacefully.

03:07.030 --> 03:08.950
To begin rules are...

03:13.520 --> 03:17.400
Today, the Robot Ball World Series begins.

03:17.510 --> 03:19.980
Seems like fun! Let me play too!

03:20.190 --> 03:21.470
Hey, Atom!

03:23.350 --> 03:24.950
ATOM!

03:35.250 --> 03:37.270
Hey! What's happening?!

03:37.630 --> 03:39.240
Hey You! Return the ball at once!

03:40.970 --> 03:42.310
Let me play too.

03:42.600 --> 03:43.660
I can't.

03:44.090 --> 03:45.160
The rules won't allow it.

03:45.530 --> 03:46.270
Rules?

03:46.880 --> 03:47.620
Tobio.

03:49.690 --> 03:50.530
Atom!

03:51.160 --> 03:52.390
Ochanomizu.

03:52.770 --> 03:54.900
Doing what you please with my Tobio!

03:58.900 --> 04:03.860
We agree that Atom is a super robot
that stopped the berserk core...

04:04.500 --> 04:07.440
...but what about his interference
during Robot Ball?

04:07.530 --> 04:08.970
Could it be a program break down?

04:09.170 --> 04:10.920
Listen, ladies and gentlemen.

04:11.110 --> 04:13.780
Atom isn't a robot
programmed to just move.

04:13.950 --> 04:16.890
He is a robot that has
the ability to think for himself!

04:17.090 --> 04:20.540
He has the same mind as humans,
it's amazing!

04:20.800 --> 04:22.770
What's so good about that?

04:22.930 --> 04:26.590
First, a mind, do you know
what that means?

04:27.320 --> 04:30.450
If he has a mind,
then why doesn't Atom respond?

04:30.800 --> 04:33.160
Right, right!
Atom, please respond!

04:33.480 --> 04:34.840
M-me?

04:35.840 --> 04:38.390
Yuka, please take Atom back.

04:38.480 --> 04:39.910
Okay, let's go Atom.

04:40.010 --> 04:41.840
We want to ask that robot!

04:41.880 --> 04:43.210
Don't take him!

04:43.240 --> 04:44.380
Listen!

04:46.020 --> 04:49.210
Okay then.
Atom has the same mind as humans.

04:49.470 --> 04:50.820
He has emotions!

04:51.040 --> 04:57.340
Atom's birth will create the ties of
friendship between humans and robots!

04:57.440 --> 04:58.220
Friendship?

04:58.510 --> 05:00.520
Robots won't work for humans?

05:00.570 --> 05:02.580
What about the problems for the robots?

05:02.640 --> 05:06.310
Also, if they have the same mind,
can't they also feel anger and hatred?

05:08.930 --> 05:12.170
Man, how can I explain it
so that they'd understand?

05:12.470 --> 05:12.960
No.

05:14.330 --> 05:16.790
Their questions have some merit to them.

05:17.210 --> 05:18.410
Inspector Tawashi!

05:18.750 --> 05:23.310
That Atom Robot,
how much power does he have?

05:23.540 --> 05:25.110
Even you don't know!

05:25.410 --> 05:27.590
Atom is not a dangerous robot!

05:28.030 --> 05:29.830
Is that so?

05:29.970 --> 05:30.810
What?

05:31.390 --> 05:34.330
Atom was not originally created by you!

05:35.080 --> 05:35.900
Isn't that right?

05:36.180 --> 05:37.040
Wh-what?

05:37.100 --> 05:38.230
I investigated it.

05:38.600 --> 05:42.240
Atom, no, Tobio was created
by a previous scientist!

05:43.230 --> 05:45.390
Who is also the suspect in the lab explosion!

05:46.890 --> 05:48.010
It was Professor Tenma!

05:48.130 --> 05:52.000
Robots will evolve and rule the humans!

05:53.850 --> 06:00.860
After Tobio was created, Tenma sealed
the robot and burned all the research data.

06:01.600 --> 06:04.310
"Robots will evolve and rule the humans!"...

06:05.090 --> 06:06.740
...those were his remaining words right?

06:08.630 --> 06:12.490
A robot created by such
a person cannot be safe!

06:12.900 --> 06:15.170
Atom has nothing to do with Tenma!

06:15.470 --> 06:19.260
That boy isn't anyone's copy!
He's a child with a mind!

06:19.490 --> 06:21.950
A mind is dangerous isn't it?

06:22.050 --> 06:23.550
No way!

06:23.710 --> 06:29.220
If robots had minds, they'd be able to
understand people. It would be wonderful!

06:33.140 --> 06:37.670
The most important thing is that
robots are here to protect humans.

06:38.020 --> 06:40.250
That's why there are rules.

06:41.350 --> 06:42.250
Rules?

06:43.250 --> 06:47.940
Listen Atom, we humans
are much weaker than robots.

06:48.110 --> 06:52.260
And if we break,
we can't be easily repaired, so...

06:55.260 --> 06:56.010
I see.

06:56.340 --> 07:03.190
Just like humans,
to process the data he must sleep.

07:04.230 --> 07:06.800
Today was a busy day, huh?

07:19.140 --> 07:20.100
Tobio.

07:21.530 --> 07:24.110
I am your creator.

07:25.890 --> 07:27.630
But I also do not...

07:28.240 --> 07:31.330
...know how much power you have.

07:31.700 --> 07:33.280
I wasn't able to confirm it.

07:53.360 --> 07:56.460
Tobio, awaken!

08:05.920 --> 08:07.720
Are you awake Atom?

08:08.740 --> 08:11.180
From today on this will be your room.

08:11.780 --> 08:12.470
Professor!

08:12.590 --> 08:13.420
Do you like it?

08:13.420 --> 08:16.200
Professor, you'll be late, hurry!

08:14.170 --> 08:15.360
Okay! Okay!

08:16.550 --> 08:18.970
Atom, today with Robita...

08:19.110 --> 08:22.550
...see how robots live in this city.

08:22.690 --> 08:24.110
Watch carefully.

08:24.180 --> 08:25.590
You're late!

08:25.670 --> 08:26.020
Okay!

08:26.040 --> 08:26.630
Hurry!

08:27.200 --> 08:28.780
Another public announcement...

08:29.650 --> 08:35.780
Tonight will be part two of
the Robot Ball World Series!

08:36.310 --> 08:38.700
The players are getting energy, right now!

08:39.070 --> 08:41.580
With no surprise, like yesterday,
it's the Omega Knights.

08:41.840 --> 08:43.230
Who will win today?

08:58.970 --> 09:00.530
You want to win.

09:01.280 --> 09:04.680
No matter what methods,
you want to beat your enemies.

09:05.190 --> 09:06.470
Right?

09:07.580 --> 09:08.980
To win...

09:17.520 --> 09:18.440
Pass!

09:19.230 --> 09:20.780
Are those robots?

09:20.920 --> 09:23.640
No, those are human kids.

09:24.590 --> 09:27.090
Okay, Omega Knights counter attack!

09:27.610 --> 09:29.540
Harley breaks through
the enemies defense!

09:29.790 --> 09:31.240
Is that the children's job?

09:31.350 --> 09:35.060
No, it's playing.
Playing is... oh! Atom!

09:35.230 --> 09:36.590
Harley Shoot!

09:39.260 --> 09:41.970
I got the ball! Let me play!

09:42.960 --> 09:44.180
Huh, that robot!

09:44.410 --> 09:45.140
Ah.

09:45.440 --> 09:47.320
You were the one that
interfered with yesterday's match.

09:47.680 --> 09:49.990
Hey, you put the ball in here right?

09:51.900 --> 09:52.930
One point!

09:53.130 --> 09:55.040
Flying in the air isn't allowed.

09:55.180 --> 09:57.940
It's cheating. That's not a point!

09:58.480 --> 09:59.160
Cheating?

09:59.540 --> 10:01.270
I'm sure he doesn't know the rules.

10:01.480 --> 10:02.500
Right?

10:03.080 --> 10:03.780
Rules?

10:04.780 --> 10:05.630
Right, rules.

10:05.810 --> 10:07.230
If everyone did there own thing...

10:07.370 --> 10:10.330
...it wouldn't be a game.
That's why rules are needed.

10:10.660 --> 10:12.970
I didn't obey the rules?

10:13.690 --> 10:14.960
I'll teach you.

10:15.070 --> 10:15.890
Really?

10:16.080 --> 10:17.670
I'm Shinichi, and you?

10:17.970 --> 10:19.140
I'm Atom!

10:19.350 --> 10:20.550
Okay, let's go Atom!

10:20.710 --> 10:21.710
Okay!

10:22.370 --> 10:27.510
Ah, to play with human kids.
I'm so jealous.

10:28.920 --> 10:31.320
Hey! Hey, hold on a minute!

10:32.310 --> 10:33.140
Alright Atom.

10:33.370 --> 10:34.830
Jump and get the ball.

10:35.180 --> 10:36.780
But no flying in the air.

10:36.970 --> 10:37.550
Got it.

10:38.010 --> 10:39.650
Play ball!

10:44.100 --> 10:46.740
It's okay to block or
attack the player with the ball.

10:46.900 --> 10:48.370
That's why you have to pass.

10:49.370 --> 10:51.370
Okay!

10:57.490 --> 10:58.850
Atom, pass!

11:02.900 --> 11:03.960
What should I do?

11:03.960 --> 11:04.630
Atom!

11:05.470 --> 11:07.570
I see. Shinichi pass!

11:09.490 --> 11:10.290
Shoot!

11:11.830 --> 11:12.660
Goal!

11:13.770 --> 11:15.370
Shinichi got a goal!

11:20.000 --> 11:21.420
Are you okay Atom?

11:21.610 --> 11:22.750
One point right?

11:23.520 --> 11:25.540
That was just a point right?!

11:26.410 --> 11:27.870
Thanks to your pass!

11:26.410 --> 11:28.560
One point! One point! One point!

11:28.070 --> 11:29.500
Isn't this fun?

11:29.770 --> 11:31.700
Yeah, it's so fun!

11:31.950 --> 11:34.050
Winning with "fair play" feels great.

11:34.510 --> 11:36.830
Omega Knights always use "fair play".

11:37.390 --> 11:39.350
That's why I'm a big Harley fan.

11:39.850 --> 11:41.000
"Fair Play"?

11:41.090 --> 11:42.340
Huh, where's the ball?

11:43.150 --> 11:45.540
Yeah, it was here a moment ago.

11:46.480 --> 11:47.770
Ah, there!

11:49.940 --> 11:52.380
Hey, that's my ball! Return it!

11:52.950 --> 11:53.720
What's that?

11:54.030 --> 11:55.150
A robot dog.

11:55.600 --> 11:59.320
Weird... It's a robot,
but it's not listening to me, a human.

12:01.600 --> 12:02.530
Ah, stop!

12:02.790 --> 12:03.640
I'll go to!

12:03.870 --> 12:05.920
Hey, let me be!

12:08.660 --> 12:11.170
Welcome! Enjoy!

12:11.750 --> 12:14.380
Welcome! It's tasty!

12:14.870 --> 12:15.890
Welcome!

12:16.690 --> 12:17.500
Wait!

12:18.280 --> 12:19.210
Welcome!

12:21.240 --> 12:22.350
Welcome!

12:25.660 --> 12:26.950
Wait!

12:33.160 --> 12:34.960
What a weird robot.

12:36.130 --> 12:39.380
Well, it's like it's leading us somewhere.

12:41.020 --> 12:41.970
Where?

12:42.400 --> 12:44.640
I don't know, but let's go see.

12:46.920 --> 12:49.120
Bye bye! Take care everyone!

12:51.120 --> 12:51.810
I'm tired.

12:54.000 --> 12:55.440
Atom, where is he?

13:00.750 --> 13:01.710
There it is!

13:03.950 --> 13:04.690
This is...

13:04.970 --> 13:09.710
Okay, Robot Ball World Series
part two, play ball!

13:09.850 --> 13:13.640
What? Atom disappeared again?!

13:13.740 --> 13:16.340
I'm so sorry Professor Ochanomizu!

13:16.620 --> 13:17.600
I should...

13:27.110 --> 13:27.940
Atom!

13:38.100 --> 13:38.840
This is...

13:41.860 --> 13:45.120
Alright! The attack begins!

13:45.560 --> 13:49.120
But the Omega Knights seem strange.

13:49.740 --> 13:52.580
That's true.
Today Harley seems kind of strange.

14:01.240 --> 14:05.870
What?! Harley made a great offence!
He attacked a player without a ball!

14:23.800 --> 14:25.750
Oh no! The judge robot needs repairs!

14:26.040 --> 14:27.330
What's wrong with Harley?!

14:28.570 --> 14:29.740
Where is Atom?

14:31.050 --> 14:31.970
There he is!

14:33.290 --> 14:35.640
I see, Robot Ball, huh?

14:36.150 --> 14:38.190
Emergency exit gate open!

15:01.700 --> 15:02.670
What the...

15:02.830 --> 15:03.400
Tobio!

15:04.860 --> 15:08.280
The world's best robot sports players...

15:08.520 --> 15:10.290
...can you beat them?

15:10.750 --> 15:12.740
What's going on?! Hey, open up!

15:15.370 --> 15:16.890
What the heck is going on?!

15:23.240 --> 15:25.430
Foolish humans.

15:26.000 --> 15:29.010
Watch this match till the end!

15:30.090 --> 15:30.900
Tobio...

15:31.370 --> 15:34.000
Accept the challenge of these robots!

15:34.340 --> 15:37.180
I-I'm Atom. I don't know any Tobio.

15:37.230 --> 15:38.020
Atom!

15:38.680 --> 15:40.160
Have a match with us!

15:40.730 --> 15:41.720
Or else...

15:49.860 --> 15:51.210
Fight Tobio!

15:51.870 --> 15:53.320
And win!

15:53.640 --> 15:56.680
Otherwise, who knows
what'll happen to the humans!

15:59.590 --> 16:04.430
The most important thing is that
robots are here to protect humans.

16:04.840 --> 16:06.090
I will fight!

16:06.460 --> 16:07.510
With "Fair Play"!

16:11.700 --> 16:13.190
The boy robot Atom...

16:13.540 --> 16:16.360
...has accepted Harley's challenge!

16:19.430 --> 16:20.050
Atom...

16:20.520 --> 16:22.350
He really accepted it?

16:22.420 --> 16:24.220
Will he be okay with that tiny body?

16:24.610 --> 16:25.890
The match's beginning.

16:28.690 --> 16:29.130
Let's go!

16:34.120 --> 16:35.450
Atom, get the ball!

16:36.860 --> 16:38.310
Atom, pass!

16:52.990 --> 16:54.320
That's it!

17:05.900 --> 17:07.490
What's going on?!

17:07.820 --> 17:09.310
Try the gate again!

17:09.750 --> 17:11.630
Haven't we contacted the police yet?

17:11.950 --> 17:14.300
Why are the robots out of control?

17:14.410 --> 17:16.930
Ah, Professor. I don't know.
I've given up.

17:17.820 --> 17:19.700
There must be a reason!

17:29.850 --> 17:31.600
I'm going after Harley!

17:42.300 --> 17:43.480
That's great Atom!

17:49.590 --> 17:51.870
Atom has no one to pass to!

17:52.360 --> 17:54.000
Atom is surrounded!

17:54.380 --> 17:55.480
What'll you do Atom?

17:55.870 --> 17:57.410
Atom is running on the wall!

17:57.590 --> 17:59.280
There's no time!

18:03.970 --> 18:06.300
Four seconds left! Three seconds!

18:07.020 --> 18:09.190
Two seconds! One!

18:12.430 --> 18:13.840
Goal!

18:14.540 --> 18:15.890
You did it Atom!

18:16.270 --> 18:17.480
Game set!

18:17.880 --> 18:19.590
Atom wins!

18:21.980 --> 18:23.570
That's power Tobio.

18:24.200 --> 18:27.940
By beating the world's best
you greatly evolve.

18:28.320 --> 18:30.410
But it's not over yet.

19:37.570 --> 19:38.870
Atom, you can do it!

19:38.920 --> 19:39.770
Atom!

19:40.500 --> 19:41.760
Don't lose Atom!

19:41.760 --> 19:42.770
You can do it!

19:42.770 --> 19:43.660
Atom!

19:43.880 --> 19:45.230
Atom!

19:45.590 --> 19:47.070
Atom!

19:47.240 --> 19:48.690
Atom!

19:49.010 --> 19:50.220
Atom!

19:57.620 --> 19:58.490
I see!

19:58.840 --> 20:00.340
Atom! The sunglasses!

20:00.790 --> 20:03.090
Aim for Harley's sunglasses!

20:04.250 --> 20:05.310
Sunglasses?

20:14.550 --> 20:15.430
Okay!

20:33.650 --> 20:38.800
What?! That tiny robot
has stopped raging Harley!

20:39.550 --> 20:40.660
Atom!

20:41.430 --> 20:42.500
Shinichi!

21:03.500 --> 21:06.080
The audience is not permitted
to enter the field.

21:06.510 --> 21:07.680
This is the rule.

21:08.130 --> 21:11.080
Harley! You're back to "Fair Play" Harley!

21:11.340 --> 21:12.580
Atom, thanks!

21:14.060 --> 21:16.650
Atom! Atom! Atom!

21:18.550 --> 21:20.970
Still using the hearts of people.

21:21.840 --> 21:22.410
Tobio...

21:23.200 --> 21:26.090
...my ultimate robot.

21:27.080 --> 21:31.580
Do not fear, for I will make you evolve.

21:32.110 --> 21:36.310
Your hidden power...
I will see how much you have!

21:52.420 --> 21:53.290
Professor Tenma...

21:57.640 --> 22:00.840
He's no longer your Tobio.

22:02.410 --> 22:03.650
He's Atom.

22:11.700 --> 22:17.230
Naze... Naze... Kokoro ga...
Why... Why... is my heart...

22:17.630 --> 22:22.840
Itamu to namida ni naru?
Is filled with pain and tears?

22:23.220 --> 22:28.730
Naze... Naze... Namida ga...
Why... Why... Tears...

22:29.010 --> 22:34.310
Ochiru to Hitori ni naru.
They fall and I'm alone.

22:34.670 --> 22:39.950
Chiisa na hiza kakae...
I hold my tiny knees...

22:40.430 --> 22:48.590
Tooku wo mata miageru.
And look up and far away.

22:48.990 --> 22:51.870
Hiroi... Hiroi...
Vast... Vast...

22:52.080 --> 23:00.080
Kono sora yori motto hiroi hazu da!
It has to be more wide than these skies!

23:00.670 --> 23:03.080
Takai... Takai...
High... High...

23:03.510 --> 23:11.790
Ano kumo yori motto takai hazu da!
It has to be higher than those clouds!

23:12.090 --> 23:16.820
Kimi no kokoro mo...
Your heart is...

23:23.580 --> 23:26.330
The robots working in space
have contracted a virus!

23:26.770 --> 23:29.310
They sent out a distress signal.
There are two holes.

23:29.760 --> 23:31.420
Professor, what's this?!

23:32.000 --> 23:34.150
Next time! Atom goes to space!

23:34.430 --> 23:36.790
With your heart... Catch the future!
